   Conversely, we now also know the sensitive ECA rules.

Proposition 6. The following rules are sensitive:
2, 3, 6, 7, 9, 10, 11, 14, 15, 18, 22, 24, 25, 26, 27, 30, 34, 35, 37, 38, 41, 42,
43, 45, 46, 54, 56, 57, 58, 60, 62, 74, 90, 105, 106, 110, 122, 126, 130, 134,
